                        "glosses": [
                            "gerelateerd aan of afkomstig uit Groenland"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39b09ba7-be1c-4a62-8457-f3f396e168ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e86fa92-1b6b-3bfa-9788-4a4952a8a6a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f40f402-0d63-3c57-8039-1f8097ade44a",
                        "target_lang_word": "grönländisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grönländisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "151597c7-e7c0-3911-9020-ebed488a205b",
                                        "entry_id": "32d72db4-0f8a-325c-a834-1d575cffffdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grönland oder Grönländer betreffend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a6d8e6e-c593-4b41-8e65-b5fb5284dda6",
                                                "sense_id": "151597c7-e7c0-3911-9020-ebed488a205b",
                                                "text": "Beim Treffen des Arktischen Rats im grönländischen Nuuk unterzeichneten die acht Außenminister, darunter US-Außenministerin Hillary Clinton und ihr russischer Kollege Sergej Lawrow, ein Abkommen über gemeinsame Rettungsaktionen bei Schiffs- und Flugzeugunglücken."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e290ce9-8a34-4ead-8ffe-626a61f5625f",
                                                "sense_id": "151597c7-e7c0-3911-9020-ebed488a205b",
                                                "text": "Geplant waren Untersuchungen zur Rotation der grönländischen Erdplatte im Paläozän und Eozän."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e94c699e-d88e-406f-8adc-1839863b28b2",
                                                "sense_id": "151597c7-e7c0-3911-9020-ebed488a205b",
                                                "text": "… erzählt: »Das Knirschen und Krachen der grönländischen Gletscher: unvorstellbar, wenn man es nicht mit eigenen Augen wahrgenommen hat…«"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a98267d-a4ce-496a-a819-acf5c9b8b0e7",
                                                "sense_id": "151597c7-e7c0-3911-9020-ebed488a205b",
                                                "text": "Diese grönländische Elite, die an dänischen Hochschulen studierte, forderte ein grönländischeres Grönland und eine eigene grönländische Kollektividentität in Abgrenzung zur dänischen Kollektividentität."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a8617902-3d7b-4f7a-bb06-46dff88948e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e86fa92-1b6b-3bfa-9788-4a4952a8a6a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f40f402-0d63-3c57-8039-1f8097ade44a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Greenlandic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Greenlandic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f1cee6b-47ef-3337-8b22-e14788e50a1f",
                                        "entry_id": "77c767b6-5874-362f-be07-6909501b29f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, from, or pertaining to Greenland, the Greenlandic people or the Greenlandic language."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a553bb29-d845-4d77-9490-b9f6b9c664d1",
                                                "sense_id": "7f1cee6b-47ef-3337-8b22-e14788e50a1f",
                                                "text": "In 2014, the Greenlandic government — called the Naalakkersuisut — established a reconciliation commission to investigate the continuing consequences of colonialism. After three years, the commission concluded that a majority of the nearly 60,000 people living in Greenland, 88 percent of whom are Greenlandic Inuit, are still marked by the negative effects of the colonial period."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Greenlandic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad9348ed-a312-3ff7-bbe2-40faca2b5846",
                                        "entry_id": "276cf5f9-526d-3748-917a-c3983533a2b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The official language of Greenland, an Eskimo-Aleut language written with the Latin alphabet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "415c86da-307e-49c5-9bbc-91e672133abe",
                                                "sense_id": "ad9348ed-a312-3ff7-bbe2-40faca2b5846",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, it may be too late—mistakes in Greenlandic already seem to have become embedded in machine translators. If you prompt either Google Translate or ChatGPT to do something as simple as count to 10 in proper Greenlandic, neither program can deliver."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
